# Centaur Courser (3/3) off Black Lotus. Attacking on turn 3, neither the Bears nor the Memnite may block it, but the
# Courser may: it takes 8 and dies (joining the spent Lotus), the Colossus takes 3 and lives, and Bot2 stays at 20.

